      "case_scope": "Both catalog-qualified CM occurrences and KG ingredient1279 identify Merck108339 at30g product/L. Agar15g/L is a separate receiving-medium ingredient. Current typical supplier composition does not establish historical lot invariance; generic Sabouraud owner remains separate and the existing release hold remains. KG empty occurrence_ids is unavailable occurrence enumeration, not a measured zero use count.",
